  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Save the Children Se/BONELA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children Sweden and BONELA - Save the Children Se/BONELA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aim  to create a platform for long-term relationships between actors  at the national, regional and international levels through Save the   Children&apos;s international operations. Save the Children&apos;s main purpose is to exert influence on the decision-makers - from municipalities to the UN - and by awakening public opinion and raising awareness of     children&apos;s needs and rights they exert influence on legislation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet &#xe4;r att skapa en plattform f&#xf6;r l&#xe5;ngsiktiga relationer mellan    parterna p&#xe5; nationell, regional och internationell niv&#xe5; genom R&#xe4;dda   Barnens internationella verksamhet. R&#xe4;dda Barnens fr&#xe4;msta syfte &#xe4;r    att ut&#xf6;va ett inflytande p&#xe5; beslutsfattare - fr&#xe5;n kommuner till FN -  och genom att v&#xe4;cka opinion och sprida kunskap om barns behov och     r&#xe4;ttigheter ut&#xf6;var de inflytande p&#xe5; lagstiftningen.</narrative>
  </description>
